---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
List templates or, with --view categories, their categories.
It prints one line per template with its id; give the id or the name in the next command.

USAGE
  holst template ls [flags]

FLAGS
  -w, --workspace ws    Where names are looked up and new things go: a workspace id or part of its name; all of yours by default
      --view view       Which templates: mine, workspace, standard or categories; mine by default
      --category slug   The template category: slug (strategic-planning), id or name; with --view standard; all by default

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst tpl ls
  $ holst tpl ls --view standard --category strategic-planning
  $ holst tpl ls --view workspace -w easy

LEARN MORE
  A template is given as its id or its name.
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
